{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0001", "kind": "fact", "text": "Orders live in PostgreSQL 16. Schema changes go through Alembic migrations.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0002", "kind": "fact", "text": "Order confirmation emails are sent by a background worker, never inside the web request.", "area": "email", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0003", "kind": "fact", "text": "Email retries use a cron job that runs every 15 minutes.", "area": "email", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0004", "kind": "fact", "text": "The payment provider webhook must verify the signature before it reads the body.", "area": "payments", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0005", "kind": "fact", "text": "Prices are stored as integer cents and never as floats.", "area": "payments", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0006", "kind": "fact", "text": "The staging site deploys from the main branch once the tests pass.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0007", "kind": "fact", "text": "Production deploys need a manual approval from a second person.", "area": "deploy", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0008", "kind": "fact", "text": "Product images are cached and expire after 24 hours.", "area": "web", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0009", "kind": "fact", "text": "The API returns errors as JSON with a code field and a message field.", "area": "api", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0010", "kind": "fact", "text": "Dates in the database are UTC. The UI converts them to the shop time zone.", "area": "db", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0011", "kind": "fact", "text": "The nightly backup runs at 02:00 and keeps 14 days of copies.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0012", "kind": "fact", "text": "The order list gets slow above 5000 rows, so it paginates at 50 rows per page.", "area": "web", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
{"type": "fact", "id": "f-20261001-0013", "kind": "fact", "text": "Feature flags live in the config file and are read at start up, so a change needs a restart.", "area": "ops", "happened_at": "2026-10-01", "learned_at": "2026-10-01T12:00:00+00:00", "source": "synthetic", "basis": "seen", "status": "active", "scope": "long", "writer": "main"}
